{
  "_id": "aZHyWcCEV5j3viPD",
  "name": "王座之旨胡帕克杖 Hoopak of Throne's Command (BMT)",
  "type": "weapon",
  "system": {
    "source": {
      "custom": "",
      "book": "BMT",
      "page": "39",
      "license": "",
      "rules": "2014",
      "revision": 1
    },
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>武器（胡帕克杖），极珍稀（需同调）</em></p><p>这把武器嵌有华丽的金丝，饰以深蓝色和栗色的珠宝。你使用该武器进行的攻击检定和伤害掷骰获得+1加值。此外，你获得威吓&amp;Reference[skill=Intimidation]和游说&amp;Reference[skill=Persuasion]两个技能中你没有熟练项技能的熟练。</p><p><em><strong>施法Spellcasting。 </strong></em>该武器有5发充能。你可以用一个附赠动作并花费1发或多发充能来施展以下法术之一（豁免 DC 16）： <em>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e_classpack.spell.Item.Ja6HpsLeGA9MQ0Rm]{命令术 Command}</em>（1充能）、 <em>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e_classpack.spell.Item.T4zFq0zTHnzZeO9t]{诚实之域 Zone of Truth}</em>（2充能）、 <em>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e_classpack.spell.Item.RpBbOYseLZCFXaFY]{强迫术 Compulsion}</em>（4 充能）、<em> @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e_classpack.spell.Item.lopw7wVkPoE7gbNu]{放逐术 Banishment}</em>（4充能）、<em>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e_classpack.spell.Item.JudswpO6E5GBlyfQ]{支配人类 Dominate Person}</em>（5充能）。</p><p>该武器每天在黎明时恢复[[/r 1d4]]发已消耗的充能。</p><p>胡帕克杖是一根结实的棍子，一端挂有投石索的结构，另一端被削成尖头。</p><p><em><strong>特殊Special。</strong></em>当你使用这种武器发动近战攻击时，你忽略其弹药词条。你同样可以将胡帕克杖当做一把军用远程武器使用。这样做时，此次攻击使用其弹药词条（用投石索子弹作为弹药），在命中时造成[[/damage 1d4 type=bludgeoning]]伤害。</p><p>This weapon is bedecked in ornate gold filigree and deep-blue and maroon jewels. You gain a +1 bonus to attack and damage rolls made with this weapon. Additionally, you gain proficiency in the &amp;Reference[skill=Intimidation] and &amp;Reference[skill=Persuasion] skills if you don't already have it.</p><div data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Spellcasting\"><p><span class=\"entry-title-inner\">Spellcasting.</span> The weapon has 5 charges. You can use a bonus action and expend 1 or more of its charges to cast one of the following spells (save DC 16): @spell[Command] (1 charge), @spell[Zone of Truth] (2 charges), @spell[Compulsion] (4 charges), @spell[Banishment] (4 charges), or @spell[Dominate Person] (5 charges).</p><p>The weapon regains [[/r 1d4]] expended charges daily at dawn.</p></div><p>A hoopak is a sturdy stick with a sling at one end and a pointed tip at the other.</p><div data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Special\"><p><span class=\"entry-title-inner\">Special.</span> When you make a melee attack with this weapon, you ignore its ammunition property. You can use the hoopak as a martial ranged weapon. If you do, it uses the ammunition property, uses sling bullets, and deals [[/damage 1d4 type=bludgeoning]] damage on a hit.</p></div>",
      "chat": ""
    },
